00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:29.540
Music for Scientists is a celebration of truth.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:34.699
It’s made in tribute to those that have
dedicated their lives to science-driven work.

00:07:34.699 --> 00:07:41.110
And the music itself is inspired by the beauty
of science and the knowable-ness of the universe.

